{
  "_comment": [
    "Which accounts each role may use, in priority order. Copy to",
    "$REVIEW_AUTH/policy.json and edit; it names accounts, so it is never in git.",
    "",
    "Order is priority: the first account with more than min_free_pct left is the",
    "one a run would use. The list is also the whole of what that role may reach,",
    "which is the point - rsync reviews a project the ArduPilot subscription does",
    "not pay for, so its lists name only the accounts that may pay for it. A role",
    "cannot fall through to an account outside its own list by running out.",
    "",
    "Names are directory names under $REVIEW_AUTH, not paths.",
    "min_free_pct   what must be left for an account to be used at all.",
    "fresh_minutes  how old a recorded reading may be before asking the account."
  ],
  "min_free_pct": 5,
  "fresh_minutes": 15,
  "roles": {
    "default": {
      "claude": ["claude-ardupilot", "claude-personal"],
      "codex": ["codex-work", "codex-personal"]
    },
    "rsync": {
      "claude": ["claude-personal"],
      "codex": ["codex-personal"]
    }
  }
}
